{
  "format": 2,
  "title": "The Pig’s Hat",
  "description": "A hat, a pot, and a very muddy pig.",
  "profile": "growing-reader",
  "notice": "A make-believe adventure with Anna and Sarah. Read and choose, or listen together.",
  "script": "story 2\nvariable pot = false hidden\nscene pig-mud\nshow Anna happy left\nshow Sarah curious right\nshow Pig neutral center\ncamera wide cut\ncamera wide cut\nI: A pig is in the mud.\nAnna [curious]: A hat for a pig?\nchoice hat\noption hat \"Get a hat.\" -> hat\noption pot \"Get a pot.\" -> pot ; pot = true\nlabel hat\nscene pig-hat\nshow Anna happy left\nshow Sarah curious right\nshow Pig happy center\ncamera wide cut\nreact Sarah laugh\nSarah [laughing]: The hat fits!\ngoto play\nlabel pot\nscene pig-pot\nshow Anna happy left\nshow Sarah curious right\nshow Pig curious center\ncamera wide cut\nreact Anna laugh\nAnna [laughing]: The pot fits!\ngoto play\nlabel play\nI: The pig can play.\nchoice play\noption hop \"Hop, pig!\" -> hop\noption sit \"Sit, pig!\" -> sit\nlabel hop\nmove Pig bounce\nSarah [happy]: Hop! Hop! Mud on us!\ngoto rest\nlabel sit\nreact Sarah laugh\nSarah [laughing]: Plop! A bum in the mud!\ngoto rest\nlabel rest\nAnna [happy]: A fun day! Time to rest.\nchoice rest\noption hug \"A hug.\" -> hug\noption nap \"A nap.\" -> nap\nlabel hug\nreact Anna excited\nAnna [happy]: A big hug. Mud on me!\ngoto endcheck\nlabel nap\nrest Sarah downcast\nSarah [happy]: Shh! The pig can nap.\ngoto endcheck\nlabel endcheck\nif pot == true -> potend else hatend\nlabel potend\nscene pig-pot\nshow Anna happy left\nshow Sarah curious right\nshow Pig curious center\ncamera wide cut\nI: A pot for a hat. It fits just right!\ngoto finish\nlabel hatend\nscene pig-hat\nshow Anna happy left\nshow Sarah curious right\nshow Pig happy center\ncamera wide cut\nI: A hat for a pig. It fits just right!\ngoto finish\nlabel finish\nAnna [happy]: I love this pig!\nend",
